  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3212.05 Noncompliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3212.05 Noncompliance. Failure to obtain and hold in its compliance account and overdraft account for any control period as of the allowance transfer deadline sufficient allowances equal to or exceeding emissions for the control period, shall result in enforcement action and penalties against the budget source pursuant to Env-A 3214.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
